    {
      "id": "s0-0",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I am a Negro:"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-1",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "Black as the night is black,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-2",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "Black like the depths of my Africa."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-3",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I’ve been a slave:"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-4",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "Caesar told me to keep his door-steps clean."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-5",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I brushed the boots of Washington."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-6",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I’ve been a worker:"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-7",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "Under my hand the pyramids arose."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-8",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I made mortar for the Woolworth Building."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-9",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I’ve been a singer:"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-10",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "All the way from Africa to Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-11",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I carried my sorrow songs."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-12",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I made ragtime."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-13",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I’ve been a victim:"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-14",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "The Belgians cut off my hands in the Congo."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-15",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "They lynch me now in Texas."
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-16",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "I am a Negro:"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-17",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "Black as the night is black,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s0-18",
      "sceneId": "s0",
      "text": "Black like the depths of my Africa."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-0",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "Droning a drowsy syncopated tune,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-1",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "Rocking back and forth to a mellow croon,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-2",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "I heard a Negro play."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-3",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "Down on Lenox Avenue the other night"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-4",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "By the pale dull pallor of an old gas light"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-5",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "He did a lazy sway...."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-6",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "He did a lazy sway...."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-7",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "To the tune o’ those Weary Blues."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-8",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "With his ebony hands on each ivory key"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-9",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "He made that poor piano moan with melody."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-10",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "O Blues!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-11",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "Swaying to and fro on his rickety stool"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-12",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "He played that sad raggy tune like a musical fool."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-13",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "Sweet Blues!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-14",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "Coming from a black man’s soul."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-15",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "O Blues!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-16",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "In a deep song voice with a melancholy tone"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-17",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "I heard that Negro sing, that old piano moan—"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-18",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "“Ain’t got nobody in all this world,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-19",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "Ain’t got nobody but ma self."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-20",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "I’s gwine to quit ma frownin’"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-21",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "And put ma troubles on the shelf.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-22",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "Thump, thump, thump, went his foot on the floor."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-23",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "He played a few chords then he sang some more—"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-24",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "“I got the Weary Blues"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-25",
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "text": "And I can’t be satisfied."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-0",
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "text": "And can’t be satisfied—"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-1",
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "text": "I ain’t happy no mo’"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-2",
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "text": "And I wish that I had died.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-3",
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "text": "And far into the night he crooned that tune."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-4",
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "text": "The stars went out and so did the moon."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-5",
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "text": "The singer stopped playing and went to bed"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-6",
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "text": "While the Weary Blues echoed through his head."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-7",
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "text": "He slept like a rock or a man that’s dead."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-0",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Oh, silver tree!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-1",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Oh, shining rivers of the soul!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-2",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "In a Harlem cabaret"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-3",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Six long-headed jazzers play."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-4",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "A dancing girl whose eyes are bold"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-5",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Lifts high a dress of silken gold."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-6",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Oh, singing tree!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-7",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Oh, shining rivers of the soul!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-8",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Were Eve’s eyes"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-9",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "In the first garden"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-10",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Just a bit too bold?"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-11",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Was Cleopatra gorgeous"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-12",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "In a gown of gold?"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-13",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Oh, shining tree!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-14",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Oh, silver rivers of the soul!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-15",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "In a whirling cabaret"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-16",
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "text": "Six long-headed jazzers play."
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-0",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "“Me an’ ma baby’s"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-1",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Got two mo’ ways,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-2",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Two mo’ ways to do de buck!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-3",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Da, da,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-4",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Da, da, da!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-5",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Two mo’ ways to do de buck!”"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-6",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Soft light on the tables,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-7",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Music gay,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-8",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Brown-skin steppers"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-9",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "In a cabaret."
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-10",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "White folks, laugh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-11",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "White folks, pray!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-12",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "“Me an’ ma baby’s"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-13",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Got two mo’ ways,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-14",
      "sceneId": "s4",
      "text": "Two mo’ ways to do de buck!”"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-0",
      "sceneId": "s5",
      "text": "One who sings “chansons vulgaires”"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-1",
      "sceneId": "s5",
      "text": "In a Harlem cellar"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-2",
      "sceneId": "s5",
      "text": "Where the jazz-band plays"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-3",
      "sceneId": "s5",
      "text": "From dark to dawn"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-4",
      "sceneId": "s5",
      "text": "Would not understand"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-5",
      "sceneId": "s5",
      "text": "Should you tell her"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-6",
      "sceneId": "s5",
      "text": "That she is like a nymph"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-7",
      "sceneId": "s5",
      "text": "For some wild faun."
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-0",
      "sceneId": "s6",
      "text": "Does a jazz-band ever sob?"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-1",
      "sceneId": "s6",
      "text": "They say a jazz-band’s gay."
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-2",
      "sceneId": "s6",
      "text": "Yet as the vulgar dancers whirled"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-3",
      "sceneId": "s6",
      "text": "And the wan night wore away,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-4",
      "sceneId": "s6",
      "text": "One said she heard the jazz-band sob"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-5",
      "sceneId": "s6",
      "text": "When the little dawn was grey."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-0",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Strut and wiggle,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-1",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Shameless gal."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-2",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Wouldn’t no good fellow"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-3",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Be your pal."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-4",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "_Hear dat music...."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-5",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Jungle night."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-6",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Hear dat music...."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-7",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "And the moon was white._"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-8",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Sing your Blues song,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-9",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Pretty baby."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-10",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "You want lovin’"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-11",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "And you don’t mean maybe."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-12",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "_Jungle lover...."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-13",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Night black boy...."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-14",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Two against the moon"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-15",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "And the moon was joy._"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-16",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Strut and wiggle,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-17",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Shameless Nan."
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-18",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Wouldn’t no good fellow"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-19",
      "sceneId": "s7",
      "text": "Be your man."
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-0",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Sleek black boys in a cabaret."
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-1",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Jazz-band, jazz-band,—"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-2",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Play, plAY, PLAY!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-3",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Tomorrow....who knows?"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-4",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Dance today!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-5",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "White girls’ eyes"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-6",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Call gay black boys."
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-7",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Black boys’ lips"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-8",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Grin jungle joys."
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-9",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Dark brown girls"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-10",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "In blond men’s arms."
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-11",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Jazz-band, jazz-band,—"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-12",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Sing Eve’s charms!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-13",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "White ones, brown ones,"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-14",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "What do you know"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-15",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "About tomorrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-16",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Where all paths go?"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-17",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Jazz-boys, jazz-boys,—"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-18",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Play, plAY, PLAY!"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-19",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Tomorrow....is darkness."
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-20",
      "sceneId": "s8",
      "text": "Joy today!"
    }
  ]
